Cell["\<\
\:534a\:5f84 radius>0\:ff0c0<theta< Pi\:ff0c0<phi<2 \
Pi\:3002\:5750\:6807\:56fe\:6392\:9664\:4e24\:6781\:3002\:5ea6\:89c4\:4e3a \
radius^2 (dtheta^2+Sin[theta]^2 dphi^2)\:3002\:8ba1\:7b97 Levi-Civita \
connection\:3001Ricci tensor \:548c Ricci \
scalar\:ff1b\:7403\:9762\:7684\:89e3\:6790\:7ed3\:679c\:4e3a Ricci=g/radius^2\
\:ff0cR=2/radius^2\:3002\:6240\:6709\:4ee3\:7801\:53ef\:5728\:5168\:65b0 \
kernel \:4e2d\:4f9d\:6b21\:6267\:884c\:3002\
